            <ArticleTitle>Genome sequence of Lactobacillus ingluviei, a bacterium associated with weight gain in animals.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5697</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report the draft genome sequence of Lactobacillus ingluviei strain Autruche 4 (CSURP209) isolated from an ostrich. L. ingluviei is associated with weight gain in mice. This genome sequence may help us understand the obesity-induced mechanisms of intestinal bacteria.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
